# rsync exclude patterns, one per line -- rsync's own glob syntax (see
# `man rsync`, PATTERN MATCHING RULES), not a shell glob and not a
# literal substring match like build-dbc.sh's manifest uses.
#
# Copy this file to deploy-dbc.exclude (or point RSYNC_EXCLUDE_FILE at
# your own path in deploy-dbc.conf) and adjust as needed. Blank lines
# and comments are fine -- rsync's own exclude-file parser ignores them.

# Images
*.png
*.jpg
*.jpeg
*.gif
*.bmp
*.tga
*.psd
*.blp
*.m2
*.M2
*.anim
*.skin

# Audio
*.mp3
*.wav
*.ogg
*.flac

# Video
*.mp4
*.mov
*.avi
*.mkv

# Archives / large misc
*.zip
*.7z
*.rar

